      "widgets_values": [
        "A smartphone photo of a small corner bakery on a quiet street just after sunrise. A wooden bench sits under the shop window, which is fogged at the edges and filled with rows of golden croissants and round sourdough loaves on wire racks. A hand-painted sign above the door reads \"OPEN EARLY\" in cream letters on dark green. Warm light spills from inside onto the wet cobblestones, and soft blue morning light fills the street behind. Natural colours, gentle shadows, fine detail in the bread crust and the painted wood."
